    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nHIGHLIGHTS\n\n- Gracious Light Filled Accommodation\n- Designed by Award Winning Architects\n- A Rated with Exceptional Levels of Energy Efficiency\n- 2 Bedroom, 2 Baths\n- 3rd Floor Home Office\n\n'Swift House' is one of the most prestigious and impressive A rated townhouses offered for sale in Dublin 4.\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\nAn exceptional opportunity to acquire a stunning newly built contemporary mews residence, discreetly positioned behind electric shutters and original granite stone walls, with the advantage of private off-street parking, in one of Dublin 4's most sought-after locations.\n\nBeautifully presented throughout in elegant neutral tones, this impressive A0-rated home combines sophisticated modern design with a superbly practical layout, offering stylish turnkey accommodation in the heart of Donnybrook.\n\nExtending to approximately 126 sq. (over 1,356 sq. ft.) the accommodation is beautifully proportioned and briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall leading to two generous double bedrooms, a luxurious bathroom and a utility room at ground floor level. The first floor opens to a magnificent open-plan kitchen, dining and living space, designed for modern living and entertaining. On the upper floor a wonderfully bright and versatile space provides the perfect setting for a home office, reading room or relaxation space opening onto a private balcony that further enhances the sense of light throughout the property.\n\nIdeally located at the Donnybrook end of the Stillorgan Road, the property enjoys unrivalled convenience with UCD campus just a short stroll away, together with an excellent selection of recreational amenities including David Lloyd Riverview, Elm Park Golf & Tennis Club, Belvedere and Donnybrook Rugby Grounds, and Merrion Cricket Club. The RDS and Aviva Stadium are also within walking distance.\n\nResidents are exceptionally well served by an array of cafés, restaurants and shopping facilities in Donnybrook and Merrion Centre, while many of Dublin's premier secondary schools and St Vincent's Public and Private Hospitals are within easy reach. The location is further enhanced by excellent transport links to the city centre and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway: - \nwith beautiful oak flooring and recessed lighting.\n\nUtility Room: - \nplumbed for washing machine, oak flooring.\n\nBedroom 1: - \ndouble bedroom with floor to ceiling built in wardrobes and study area.\n\nEnsuite Shower Room: - \ndouble shower cubicle with rain forest shower head, w.c, wash hand basin with underneath storage press and overhead mirror, heated towel rail, oak flooring, tiled walls and recessed lighting.\n\nBedroom 2: - \ndouble bedroom with floor to ceiling built in wardrobes and recessed lighting.\n\nGuest Shower Room: - \nluxurious shower room, double cubicle with rainforest shower head, wc. and wash hand basin with underneath storage cupboard and overhead mirror, heated towel rail, oak flooring. Fully tiled walls and recessed lighting.\n\nUPSTAIRS - \n\n\nLiving/Dining/Kitchen: - \nstunning open plan room, flooded with natural light, recessed lighting , oak floor. Superb range of built in wall and floor presses, integrated oven, hob, extractor fan, grill, microwave, fridge freezer and dishwasher.\n\nPenthouse Office/Reading/Relaxation Room: - \nbeautiful oak flooring, sliding doors to the decked balcony, recessed lighting.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Private off-street parking</li><li>A0 rated newly built mews</li><li>Double glazed windows</li><li>Balcony</li><li>Flooded with natural light throughout</li><li>Excellent location</li><li>Freehold title with no service/management charges</ul>"
      },
